<title>JAPAN: Kanematsu Woolen - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanematsu Woolen - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.55		vs	    7.71</p>
<p> Operating	   80    mln	  vs	   83    mln</p>
<p> Current	     57    mln	  vs	   54    mln</p>
<p> Net		   24    mln	  vs	   14    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    1.73 yen	  vs	    1.03 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>    NOTE - Kanematsu Woolen Mills Ltd is a synthetic fibre yarn maker.</p>
